# PHASE 7 – PROJECT DOCUMENTATION PHASE

## Project Name

**Employee Data Import and Management System Using ServiceNow**

## 1. Introduction

The Project Documentation Phase provides complete documentation of the Employee Data Import and Management System.

It includes the project idea, requirements, design, development process, testing results, screenshots, and final outcome.

## 2. Project Overview

The project demonstrates how employee information can be imported from an Excel spreadsheet into ServiceNow using Import Sets and Transform Maps.

The imported data is mapped to the Employee Test table and verified after transformation.

## 3. Technologies Used

* ServiceNow Developer Instance
* Microsoft Excel / Spreadsheet
* Import Sets
* Transform Maps
* Mapping Assist
* ServiceNow Tables
* GitHub
* Web Browser

## 4. Project Workflow

```text
Excel Spreadsheet
       ↓
Load Data
       ↓
Import Set
       ↓
Transform Map
       ↓
Field Mapping
       ↓
Data Transformation
       ↓
Employee Test Table
       ↓
Final Records
```

