## 6. Testing Summary

The project was tested to verify the complete data import process.

The testing confirmed that the employee data was successfully loaded, mapped, transformed, and stored in the target table.

## 7. Project Benefits

* Reduces manual data entry.
* Saves time.
* Provides structured employee data.
* Reduces data entry errors.
* Demonstrates ServiceNow Import Sets.
* Demonstrates Transform Maps.
* Provides practical ServiceNow experience.

## 8. Final Outcome

The Employee Data Import and Management System successfully imports employee information from an Excel spreadsheet into the Employee Test table in ServiceNow.

